const CALPOOL={PR:['NSR','SB','ST','AVB1','AVB2I','JR','SA'],QRS:['NSR','SB','PVC','AVB3','VT','AVB2II','JR'],RR:['NSR','SB','ST','SA','AF','AVB3','SVT']};
const CALT={PR:['PR 간격','P파가 시작하는 곳에 왼쪽 다리, QRS가 시작하는 곳에 오른쪽 다리를 놓으세요.'],QRS:['QRS 폭','QRS가 기준선을 떠나는 곳과 돌아오는 곳(J점)에 두 다리를 놓으세요.'],RR:['R–R 간격','연속된 두 R파의 꼭대기에 두 다리를 놓으세요. 심박수가 함께 계산됩니다.']};
function calHTML(){const C=st.cal;return '<section class="l2-card"><div class="l2-ch"><span class="l2-num">캘리퍼</span><div><h3>캘리퍼 측정 실습</h3><p class="muted">다리를 끌어 맞춥니다. 위쪽 막대를 끌면 간격을 유지한 채 함께 이동합니다(P파 행진에 유용). 손가락으로도 됩니다.</p></div></div>'+
 '<div class="l2-row">'+seg('ctask',C.task,[['PR','PR 간격'],['QRS','QRS 폭'],['RR','R–R · 심박수']])+'<label class="l2-sel">리듬 <select id="l2-crh">'+'<option value="rand">무작위</option>'+CALPOOL[C.task].map(id=>'<option value="'+id+'"'+(C.rh===id?' selected':'')+'>'+H(shortOf(id))+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label><button class="btn sm" data-l2="cnew">새 스트립</button></div>'+
 '<p class="l2-task" id="l2-ctask"><b>'+CALT[C.task][0]+'</b> '+CALT[C.task][1]+'</p>'+
 '<div class="l2-cvwrap"><canvas class="l2-cv l2-calcv" id="l2-cv-cal"></canvas></div>'+
 '<div class="l2-calbar"><div class="l2-calread" id="l2-cread"></div><div class="l2-nudge"><span>왼쪽</span><button class="btn sm" data-l2="nudge" data-v="a,-1" aria-label="왼쪽 다리 왼쪽으로">◀</button><button class="btn sm" data-l2="nudge" data-v="a,1" aria-label="왼쪽 다리 오른쪽으로">▶</button><span>오른쪽</span><button class="btn sm" data-l2="nudge" data-v="b,-1" aria-label="오른쪽 다리 왼쪽으로">◀</button><button class="btn sm" data-l2="nudge" data-v="b,1" aria-label="오른쪽 다리 오른쪽으로">▶</button></div>'+
 '<div class="l2-ca"><button class="btn primary" data-l2="ccheck">확인</button><button class="btn" data-l2="cshow">정답 보기</button></div></div><p class="l2-fb" id="l2-cfb"></p><p class="muted l2-score" id="l2-cscore"></p></section>';}
let calDrag=null;
function calInit(){calBuild();const cv=$('#l2-cv-cal');
 const pos=e=>{const r=cv.getBoundingClientRect();return[e.clientX-r.left,e.clientY-r.top];};
 cv.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{const s=S.cal;if(!s||!s.w)return;const[x,y]=pos(e),C=st.cal,X=t=>(t-s.o.t0)*s.pps,xa=X(C.a),xb=X(C.b);let mode;
  if(Math.abs(x-xa)<=18&&Math.abs(x-xa)<=Math.abs(x-xb))mode='a';else if(Math.abs(x-xb)<=18)mode='b';else if(y<40&&x>Math.min(xa,xb)&&x<Math.max(xa,xb))mode='bar';else{mode=Math.abs(x-xa)<Math.abs(x-xb)?'a':'b';C[mode]=s.o.t0+x/s.pps;}
  calDrag={mode,x0:x,a:C.a,b:C.b,id:e.pointerId};try{cv.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);}catch(_){}C.res=null;s.dirty=true;calRead();e.preventDefault();});
 cv.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!calDrag)return;const s=S.cal,[x]=pos(e),C=st.cal,dt=(x-calDrag.x0)/s.pps,lo=s.o.t0,hi=s.o.t0+s.secs;
  if(calDrag.mode==='a')C.a=clamp(calDrag.a+dt,lo,hi);else if(calDrag.mode==='b')C.b=clamp(calDrag.b+dt,lo,hi);else{const w=calDrag.b-calDrag.a;let na=calDrag.a+dt;na=clamp(na,lo-Math.min(0,w),hi-Math.max(0,w));C.a=na;C.b=na+w;}
  s.dirty=true;calRead();});
 const up=()=>{calDrag=null;};cv.addEventListener('pointerup',up);cv.addEventListener('pointercancel',up);
 cv.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{});}
function calBuild(){const C=st.cal;if(S.cal)S.cal.destroy();C.seed=sd();const pool=CALPOOL[C.task],id=C.rh!=='rand'&&pool.includes(C.rh)?C.rh:pick(pool);C.id=id;const v=RD[id].vars?RD[id].vars[RD[id].vars.length-1][0]:null;
 const t0=1.5+Math.random()*2;const s=new Strip($('#l2-cv-cal'),{mode:'static',t0,secs:4.2,minPx:4,maxPx:11,laneMm:26,minLane:170,maxLane:300});s.set([new Model(id,{seed:C.seed,v:id==='PVC'?'big':v})]);S.cal=s;
 C.a=t0+s.secs*0.3;C.b=t0+s.secs*0.42;C.res=null;C.show=false;s.over=calOver;const fb=$('#l2-cfb');if(fb){fb.textContent='';fb.className='l2-fb';}calRead();calScore();
 requestAnimationFrame(()=>{if(S.cal&&S.cal.w){C.a=t0+S.cal.secs*0.3;C.b=t0+S.cal.secs*0.42;S.cal.dirty=true;calRead();}});}
function calTruth(){const C=st.cal,s=S.cal,m=s.lanes[0].model,els=m.range(s.o.t0,s.o.t0+s.secs),lo=s.o.t0,hi=s.o.t0+s.secs,a=Math.min(C.a,C.b),b=Math.max(C.a,C.b);let best=null,bd=1e9;
 const tryP=(x,y)=>{if(x<lo||y>hi)return;const d=Math.abs(x-a)+Math.abs(y-b);if(d<bd){bd=d;best=[x,y];}};
 if(C.task==='PR')els.forEach(e=>{if(e.k==='P'&&e.q)tryP(e.t,e.q.t);});
 else if(C.task==='QRS')els.forEach(e=>{if(e.k==='Q')tryP(e.t,e.t+e.d);});
 else{const qs=els.filter(e=>e.k==='Q');for(let i=1;i<qs.length;i++)tryP(qs[i-1].t+rOff(qs[i-1]),qs[i].t+rOff(qs[i]));}
 return best;}
function calRead(){const C=st.cal,el=$('#l2-cread');if(!el)return;const d=Math.abs(C.b-C.a),s=S.cal;
 el.innerHTML='<span class="big num">'+d.toFixed(3)+'<small>초</small></span><span>작은 칸 '+(d/0.04).toFixed(1)+'개</span>'+(C.task==='RR'?'<span>심박수 '+(d>0.05?Math.round(60/d):'–')+'회/분</span>':'<span>'+(C.task==='PR'?'정상 0.12–0.20초':'정상 0.12초 미만')+'</span>');}
function calOver(c,s){const C=st.cal,X=t=>(t-s.o.t0)*s.pps,xa=X(C.a),xb=X(C.b),Hh=s.h,fs=fsz(),col='#2fd3bf';
 c.fillStyle='rgba(47,211,191,.08)';c.fillRect(Math.min(xa,xb),0,Math.abs(xb-xa),Hh);
 if(C.show||C.res){const tr=calTruth();if(tr){c.strokeStyle=COL.ok||'#41dd88';c.strokeStyle='#41dd88';c.setLineDash([5,4]);c.lineWidth=1.6;[tr[0],tr[1]].forEach(t=>{c.beginPath();c.moveTo(X(t),24);c.lineTo(X(t),Hh-4);c.stroke();});c.setLineDash([]);c.fillStyle='#41dd88';c.font='600 '+(fs-1)+'px '+FONT();c.textAlign='center';c.fillText('정답 '+(tr[1]-tr[0]).toFixed(2)+'초',(X(tr[0])+X(tr[1]))/2,Hh-8);c.textAlign='left';}}
 c.strokeStyle=col;c.lineWidth=2;[xa,xb].forEach(x=>{c.beginPath();c.moveTo(x,18);c.lineTo(x,Hh-6);c.stroke();});
 c.lineWidth=4;c.beginPath();c.moveTo(xa,18);c.lineTo(xb,18);c.stroke();
 [xa,xb].forEach(x=>{c.fillStyle=col;c.beginPath();c.arc(x,18,7,0,PI2);c.fill();c.fillStyle='#04221e';c.beginPath();c.arc(x,18,2.5,0,PI2);c.fill();c.fillStyle=col;c.beginPath();c.moveTo(x,Hh-6);c.lineTo(x-6,Hh);c.lineTo(x+6,Hh);c.closePath();c.fill();});
 const d=Math.abs(C.b-C.a),t=d.toFixed(2)+'초';c.font='700 '+fs+'px '+FONT();const w=c.measureText(t).width,cx=clamp((xa+xb)/2,w/2+6,s.w-w/2-6);c.fillStyle='rgba(4,34,30,.92)';rr(c,cx-w/2-6,24,w+12,fs+8,5);c.fill();c.fillStyle=col;c.textAlign='center';c.fillText(t,cx,24+fs+2);c.textAlign='left';}
function calCheck(){const C=st.cal,tr=calTruth(),fb=$('#l2-cfb');if(!tr||!fb)return;const a=Math.min(C.a,C.b),b=Math.max(C.a,C.b),meas=b-a,tv=tr[1]-tr[0],diff=meas-tv,ea=a-tr[0],eb=b-tr[1];
 const ok=Math.abs(diff)<=0.02&&Math.abs(ea)<=0.04,close=Math.abs(diff)<=0.04;C.res=ok?'ok':close?'close':'no';C.score.n++;if(ok)C.score.ok++;prog.cal.n++;if(ok)prog.cal.ok++;lsSet(PKEY,prog);
 let tip='';if(Math.abs(ea)>0.03)tip+=' 왼쪽 다리가 '+(ea<0?'이릅니다':'늦습니다')+' ('+Math.abs(ea).toFixed(2)+'초).';if(Math.abs(eb)>0.03)tip+=' 오른쪽 다리가 '+(eb<0?'이릅니다':'늦습니다')+' ('+Math.abs(eb).toFixed(2)+'초).';
 const extra=C.task==='PR'?(tv>0.2?' PR이 0.20초를 넘습니다 — 1도 차단 소견.':' PR 정상 범위.'):C.task==='QRS'?(tv>=0.12?' 넓은 QRS(0.12초 이상).':' 좁은 QRS.'):' 심박수 약 '+Math.round(60/tv)+'회/분.';
 fb.innerHTML=(ok?'<b class="ok">정확합니다.</b>':close?'<b class="warn">거의 맞았습니다.</b>':'<b class="bad">차이가 큽니다.</b>')+' 측정 '+meas.toFixed(2)+'초 · 실제 '+tv.toFixed(2)+'초 (차이 '+(diff>=0?'+':'')+diff.toFixed(2)+'초).'+tip+extra+' <span class="muted">리듬: '+H(shortOf(C.id))+'</span>';fb.className='l2-fb show';S.cal.dirty=true;calScore();}
function calScore(){const el=$('#l2-cscore');if(el)el.textContent='이번 세션 '+st.cal.score.ok+' / '+st.cal.score.n+' 정확 · 누적 '+prog.cal.ok+' / '+prog.cal.n;}
function calShow(){const C=st.cal,tr=calTruth();if(!tr)return;C.show=true;const a0=C.a,b0=C.b,t0=now();const anim=()=>{const f=clamp((now()-t0)/450,0,1),e=1-Math.pow(1-f,3);C.a=a0+(tr[0]-a0)*e;C.b=b0+(tr[1]-b0)*e;if(S.cal)S.cal.dirty=true;calRead();if(f<1&&S.cal)requestAnimationFrame(anim);};anim();}

